/surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name><name><surname>Rohlf</surname><given-names>FJ</given-names></name></person-group> <source>Introduction to biostatistics</source>. <comment>2nd ed.</comment> <publisher-loc>New York</publisher-loc>: <publisher-name>WH Freeman</publisher-name>, <year>1987</year></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b23"><label>23</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><collab>Etude r&#x000e9;alis&#x000e9;e par le Centre de Formation et de Recherche en M&#x000e9;decine et Maladies Infectieuses (CEFORMI)</collab> <article-title>Enquete nationale de seroprevalence de l&#x02019;infection par le VIH au Burundi Bujumbura: Minist&#x000e8;re de la Sante Publique, Minist&#x000e8;re &#x000e0; la Pr&#x000e9;sidence Charg&#x000e9; de la Lutte contre le Sida, Banque Mondiale</article-title>, <year>2002</year></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b24"><label>24</label><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><collab>Ministry of Health (MOH) [Uganda], ORC Macro</collab> <source>Uganda HIV/AIDS sero-behavioural survey 2004&#x02013;2005</source>. <publisher-loc>Calverton, MD</publisher-loc>: <publisher-name>Ministry of Health and ORC Macro</publisher-name>, <year>2006</year></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b25"><label>25</label><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ouagadjio</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Nodjimadji</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Bagamla</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><etal/></person-group> . <source>Enquete nationale de seroprevalence du VIH/SIDA au Tchad 2005</source>. <publisher-loc>Chad</publisher-loc>: <publisher-name>Ministere de l&#x02019;Economie du Plan et de la Cooperation, Ministere de la Sante Publique</publisher-name>, <year>2005</year></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b26"><label>26</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><collab>Programa Nacional de Lucha Contra el SIDA (MINSABS), Proyecto Centro de Referencia para el Control de Endemias en Guinea Ecuatorial (CNMT-ISCIII)</collab> <article-title>Informe final de la encuesta de seroprevalencia del VIH en Guinea Ecuatorial 2004.</article-title> <comment>Guinea Ecuatorial: MINSABS, CNMT-ISCIII</comment>, <year>2004</year></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b27"><label>27</label><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Louboutin-Croc</surname><given-names>JP</given-names></name><name><surname>Boisier</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Amadou</surname><given-names>HA</given-names></name><etal/></person-group> <source>Enqu&#x000ea;te Nationale de S&#x000e9;ropr&#x000e9;valence de l&#x02019;Infection par le VIH dans la population g&#x000e9;n&#x000e9;rale &#x000e2;g&#x000e9;e de 15 &#x000e0; 49 ans au Niger (2002)</source>. <publisher-loc>Niamey</publisher-loc>: <publisher-name>Centre de Recherche Medicale et Sanitaire</publisher-name>, <year>2002</year></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b28"><label>28</label><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><collab>NIMBA Research Consultancy, Statistics Sierra Leone, Ministry of Health and Sanitation, National HIV/AIDS Secretariat (NAS)</collab> <source>National Population Based HIV Seroprevalence Survey of Sierra Leone</source>. <publisher-loc>Freetown</publisher-loc>: <publisher-name>NAS</publisher-name>, <year>2005</year></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b29"><label>29</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Montana</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Mishra</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Hong</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group> <article-title>Comparison of HIV prevalence estimates from antenatal care surveillance and population-based surveys in sub-Saharan Africa.</article-title> <source>Sex Transm Infect</source> <year>2008</year>;<volume>84</volume><issue>(Suppl I)</issue>:<fpage>i78</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>i84</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18647871</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b30"><label>30</label><mixed-citation publication-type="book"><collab>UNAIDS Reference Group on Estimates Modelling and Projections</collab> <source>Improving parameter estimation, projection methods, uncertainty estimation, and epidemic classification</source>. <comment>Report of a meeting of the UNAIDS Reference Group on Estimates, Modelling and Projections held in Prague, Czech Republic, 29 November&#x02013;1 December 2006.</comment> <publisher-loc>London</publisher-loc>: <publisher-name>Imperial College</publisher-name>, <year>2006</year></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="b31"><label>31</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lyerla</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Gouws</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Garcia-Calleja</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name></person-group> <article-title>The quality of sero-surveillance in low- and middle income countries: status and trends through 2007.</article-title> <source>Sex Transm Infect</source> <year>2008</year>;<volume>84</volume><issue>(Suppl I)</issue>:<fpage>i85</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>i91</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18647872</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>